      {
        "id": "def-rpm-h-poincare-charge-space",
        "kind": "definition",
        "domain": "mathematics",
        "title": "Poincare semidirect group, dual pairing and moment components",
        "statement": "Assume $\\mathrm{AC}_\\omega$ for the referenced cotangent and symplectic-action conventions. Work on affine Minkowski spacetime with inertial coordinates $x^0=ct,x^1,x^2,x^3$ in metres, metric matrix $\\eta=\\operatorname{diag}(-1,1,1,1)$, and cotangent coordinates $(x^a,p_a)$, where each $p_a$ has SI momentum units. Fix the future cone as the timelike component containing the positive $x^0$ axis, equivalently $v^0>\\lvert\\mathbf v\\rvert$. Let $SO^+(1,3)$ denote the determinant-one, future-cone-preserving Lorentz subgroup. Define the proper orthochronous Poincaré group and its multiplication by\n\n$$G=\\mathbb R^4\\rtimes SO^+(1,3),\\qquad (a,\\Lambda)(b,L)=(a+\\Lambda b,\\Lambda L).$$\n\nIts action on spacetime and the cotangent lift are $x'=\\Lambda x+a$ and $p'=\\Lambda^{-T}p$. The Lie algebra consists of pairs $(a,A)$ with $A^T\\eta+\\eta A=0$, bracket\n\n$$[(a,A),(b,B)]=(Ab-Ba,[A,B]).$$\n\nUse the library convention $\\xi_M=\\left.\\frac d{ds}\\right|_0\\exp_G(-s\\xi)\\cdot z$. Thus the positive affine generator on spacetime is $Y_{(a,A)}(x)=a+Ax$, the fundamental field is its negative, and the cotangent-lifted positive field is $(a+Ax,-A^Tp)$. Pair the cotangent point with a Lie-algebra element by\n\n$$\\ell_{(a,A)}(x,p)=p_b(a^b+A^b{}_cx^c).$$\n\nDefine $P^a=\\eta^{ab}p_b$ and $J^{ab}=x^aP^b-x^bP^a$. The equivalent dual pairing is $\\ell_{(a,A)}=p_ba^b-\\tfrac12J_{bc}A^{bc}$, where $A^{bc}=A^b{}_d\\eta^{dc}$ and $J_{bc}=\\eta_{bd}\\eta_{ce}J^{de}$. Here $[P^a]=\\mathrm{kg\\,m/s}$ and $[J^{ab}]=\\mathrm{J\\,s}$. These are charge-space definitions on the full cotangent bundle; shell reduction and the moment-map identities are stated separately. No spin or particle model is included.",
        "deps": [
          "thm-sr-proper-orthochronous-lorentz-algebra",
          "def-rpm-h-cotangent-phase-space",
          "def-symplectic-and-hamiltonian-lie-group-action",
          "thm-a-regular-level-set-is-an-embedded-submanifold",
          "def-countable-choice",
          "lem-timelike-cone-has-two-convex-components",
          "lem-lorentz-lie-algebra-structure"
        ],
        "dependency_roles": {
          "thm-sr-proper-orthochronous-lorentz-algebra": "mathematical-premise",
